window.products.push({"id":116270,"name":"Genius Air Plus Refrigerator Refresher & Deodorizer (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512R2LSBt1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fruits and vegetables are treated with pesticides, and other kinds of foods already have visible and invisible mildew and bacteria on them when they are purchased - refrigerators are used for the storage of many different kinds of foods which create many different kinds of odors. There is no circulating air inside the refrigerator, so the bacteria can spread and the pesticides cannot dissipate. The Genius Air PLUS helps on the basis of ionization technology: it generates negative ions which in turn clean the air in your refrigerator, reducing all sorts of bacteria along with stale and foul odors. It makes sure that you can keep foods fresh for longer and your refrigerator always smells fresh. In addition, the Genius Air PLUS helps to reduce ethylene gas, a ripening agent, which causes fruit to decay and vegetables to wilt, producing disagreeable odors. Operation of the Genius Air PLUS and the monitoring of its many-sided functions is child’s play and possible at all times with the integrated LED display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512R2LSBt1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Genius Air Plus","source_asin":"B013R6NAI2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013R6NAI2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B013R6NAI2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
