window.products.push({"id":116560,"name":"Electric Ceramic Cooktop, 30 Inch Built in Electirc Stove Top with Knob Control, 4 Burners Electric Radiant Cooker with 9 Power Level, Heat Indicator,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tQafrgD6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The electric cooktop makes cooking and cleaning especially easy. Easy to clean, safer and intelligent, the vitro-ceramic heating technology is an efficient kitchen must have. Your pots and pans have direct contact with the surface which means no heat or energy is wasted. It also offers a residual heat indicator. When the cooktop is turned off, there will still be some residual heat. The letter 'H' appears to warn you when the surface has not cooled down enough. Specifications: Heat Indicator Light: Yes Child Safety Lock: Yes Control Type: Touch Control Power Levels: 9 Power supply 220V-240V, 50/60Hz. It generates total 6000W high power Electrical Fuse Rating: 32amp (power cord without plug) Cooktop Dimension: 30\" x 20\" x 2\" Cut Out Size: 29\" x 19.3\" Tips: Please check the size before purchasing. Please make sure that the 2 fire wires from the electric cooktop(L1 and L2) are connected together and then connected to your fire wire connection. As with all electrical installations, installation should be performed by a qualified electrician. Please follow the installation instructions for your electric cooktop. For best results with your electric cooktop, simply wipe it down with a damp cloth after use and it will be as good as new. Make sure the heat indicator light is off and the cooktop is cool to the touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tQafrgD6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cazooo","source_asin":"B0B9S93L4C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9S93L4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9S93L4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":116561,"name":"AQUA CREST 12033030 Replacement for Bosch® UltraClarity® Pro BORPLFTR50, 11032531 Refrigerator Water Filter, Compatible with 11025825, BORPLFTR55, B36","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8195Bm1XrXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you get in this AQUA CREST refrigerator water filter is an excellent prior filtration performance that stands on par with what you get from the original brand, backed by the standard NSF 42 and 372 certifications. Unlike the generic brands, our refrigerator water filter relies on the 100% superior coconut shell carbon block to get rid of different types of things from your water. Replacement for models: Bosch UltraClarity Pro BORPLFTR50 Water Filter, BORPLFTR55 Water Filter, REPLFLTR55, REPLFTR50, REPLFTR55,12033030 Water Filter, 11032531 Water Filter, 11025825, 12028325, 11050659, 11041954, RA450022, WFC100MF, WFC110MF, WFS200MF, WFS210MF Refrigerator Water Filter. Compatible with: Bosch B36CLSN, B36CT80, B36CL80E, B36CD50, B22CS50, B36CAUS1, B36CAUS2, B36CD50SNS, B36FD50SNS, B36CT80SNS, B36CL81ENG, B36CT80SNB, B36CT80ENS, B36CT81SNS, B36CL80ENS, B36CL80SNS, B36CD50SNB, B36BT935NS, B30BB935SS, B36IT905NP, B30IB905SP, B18IF905SP 100% fit: The precise production technology adopted by AQUA CREST in this refrigerator water filter means you get a perfect fit, just like the original scale. Besides, AQUA CREST ensures that this DIY process will not take you more than a few minutes. Month install stickers: This filter comes with stickers that help you mark the installation date. Now you can worry less about overusing your filter, thanks to this simple yet effective replacement date reminder. You get up to 6 months or 300 gallons of pure-tasting water, depending on the conditions of your water. Excellent filtration beyond your mind: AQUA CREST water filters can reduce such a wide range of harmful substances at a go including suspended particles, copper, VOCs, THM, chromium and chlorine from your drinking water. An independent third-party laboratory has verified this claim. High-quality filter material: AQUA CREST brings you an upgrade with a 100% selected coconut shell carbon block. The surface area is larger. There are also more micropores to increase the filtration process’s efficiency, giving no chance to impurities like bad taste and odor, sediments, chlorine, and heavy metals tested by third laboratory. 100% safe materials: AQUA CREST adopted BPA-free and food-grade materials in making this refrigerator filter. This claim is verified and backed by the NSF 372 certification that declares this filter housing lead-free. Comprehensive product line: We have experts with many years of experience in product development, and they have made AQUA CREST a substantial and high-quality replacement filter solution. With our comprehensive product line of replacement filters and adaptative technology, we take pride in providing clean and fresh water to your hydrated home. Customer support: Our customer service team is always here to get you back. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8195Bm1XrXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aqua Crest","source_asin":"B0BDDS27FL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDDS27FL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDDS27FL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
