window.products.push({"id":116651,"name":"12112425 Belt Kit Replacement Compatible with Maytag, AP4011179, PS2005284, Washer Belt Pump And Drive (211125 & 211124)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EelvvWULL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATIONS: 211124 211125 Washer Belt Set includes both the drive belt and the pump belt which are both V-shaped. If your washer does not toss, spin, or drain water properly, this might be because one of these belts has worn or stretched out. This results in the belt losing its grip and no longer driving the pump. The pump belt is black and made of rubber. The pump belt is located between the motor and pump underneath the washer. Simply remove the belt and hook the new one around the pulley. You may need to loosen or tighten the belt to ensure it is set in place properly. Fits Models: - LA512 LAT9416AAE A506 A806 LAT2600AAE LAT9304AAE - LAT9304AAL LAT9304AAM LAT9304ABE MAT12CSDAQ MAT12CSDAW - MAT12CSFWQ MAT12CSFWW MAT12CSLWQ MAT12CSLWW MAT12PRDAW MAT12PSDAW Fixes the following symptoms: Burning smell / Will not agitate / Will not drain / Noisy How to Replace a Washing Machine Belt: Gently turn the washing machine on its side once you determine that your model runs with a drive belt Locate the washing machine belt, which will be black in color, Remove the clamps that connect rubber coupling, the belt and washing machine motor Slide the old washing machine drive belt off the transmission and motor pulleys, Replace the new washing machine drive belt by slipping it over the transmission and motor pulleys from which you removed the old belt Reconnect the rubber coupling and the clamps over the new washing machine belt. ▲Warning: The product is not sponsored or endorsed by ,or affiliated with the brands it fit ,including Whirlpool, Roper, Admiral, Maytag, Hardwick, Jenn-Air, Estate, Magic Chef, Crosley, Inglis, Norge, Modern Maid, Amana, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Caloric, Ikea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EelvvWULL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wadoy","source_asin":"B07DRDHHH4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DRDHHH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DRDHHH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
