window.products.push({"id":116751,"name":"Tylza Wine and Beverage Refrigerator 24 Inch Dual Zone, French Door Wine and Beverage Cooler 24'' Built-In or Freestanding Drink Fridge, Under Counter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rUM2siPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2-In-1 Smart Independent Cooling Zones】This wine and beverage refrigerator is designed to provide you with ultimate control over your cooling needs. The left zone temperature range is 35-50°F, while the right zone temperature range is 41-64°F. With a large capacity of up to 18 standard Bordeaux 750ml wine bottles and 57 standard 12oz can drink, you can easily chill your drinks and wines to perfection. 【Powerful and Quiet Cooling System】The Tylza compressor wine and beverage cooler is equipped with a powerful and quiet cooling system that can effectively provide fast, strong, stable cooling and accurate humidity control, ensuring your drinks are preserved in the best condition. The fridge operates with low vibration, and the noise level can be controlled to under 38 dB, providing a quiet environment for your home. 【Easy-to-Use Touch Screen and Auto-Defrost】This dual-zone wine and beer fridge comes with an easy-to-use touch screen that allows you to adjust the temperature and light settings with just a touch. You can also lock the temperature settings with the lock button. The white LED light lets you view the temperature and interior condition even in the dark. The fridge is also auto-defrosting every 6 hours, eliminating the need for manual intervention. 【Tempered Glass Door and 2 Safety Locks】The wine and beverage fridge features double tempered glass doors and a seamless design to ensure safe operation and seamless air separation. The door will automatically lock when you close it, and the soft-close doors feature magnetic seals. There is also a door key lock on the bottom of the fridge to prevent accidents that may harm children. 【Built-In or Freestanding Installation】The 24\" wide wine and beverage fridge can be installed as a built-in under a counter or as a freestanding unit. It requires only 34.25 x 23.42 x 22.63 inches of space and can be installed easily. The built-in installation enables a maximum door opening angle of 180 degrees, and the freestanding style allows for a maximum of 225 degrees. The user-friendly design allows you to manage your wine collection or drinks with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rUM2siPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tylza","source_asin":"B0CCSNVLPM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CCSNVLPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CCSNVLPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
