window.products.push({"id":116840,"name":"Washing Machine, 1.8 Cu ft Compact Washer Machine With 8 Wash Programs & Child Lock, Full-Automatic Laundry Machine, Ideal For Dormitory Apartment Liv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716MVRe1FES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧦【8 Wash Programs】This portable washer contains 8 programs, namely: Standard, Spin, Quick, Soak, Gentle, Air Dry, Retain Water, Clean. The combination of multiple programs can make your clothes cleaner and softer. In general, these 8 programs can better meet our needs in different situations. 🧦【Child Lock Protection】This clothes washing machine has a child lock function, which can be triggered by pressing the \"program\" and \"water level\" buttons at the same time. Except for the power button, all buttons fail and an alarm will sound when the lid is opened, which greatly protects the safety of children. Moreover, the washing process will not be interrupted! 🧦【High Quality Stainless Steel Barrel】This portable laundry machine bucket is made of high-quality special stainless steel material. There are many small cubes protruding from the outside of the bucket, and the groove contains drainage holes. It can gently massage clothes, remove stains and dehydrate quickly. In addition, the stains remaining in the bucket can also be easily taken away by the water flow, and will not cause secondary pollution to the clothes. 🧦【Special Function】This compact washing machine contains a \"air dry\" button, press this switch after washing the clothes. The inner barrel will rotate at a high speed to generate strong wind, which can keep the inner barrel dry. Press the \"clean\" button, this washing machine will form a super-high speed to drive water to wash the walls of the inner and outer barrels, and easily get out the remaining stains. 🧦【Compact Size & High Capacity】The appearance of this automatic washing machine is very compact. It is designed for small rooms and does not take up too much space. This wash machine has a capacity of up to 12lbs. You can put multiple pieces of clothing at the same time at one time. It can fully meet your needs. In general, it can save you space and energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716MVRe1FES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B098NHD872","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098NHD872","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B098NHD872","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
