window.products.push({"id":116847,"name":"Beaquicy SP21YA Surface Burner Element - Replacement for GE Kenmore Hotpoint Electric Range Stove - Replaces WB30T10071 WB30X253 9761346-8 Inch 4 Turn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pB20LRSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT DESCRIPTION】---SP21YA Surface Burner Element 8 Inch with a Y-style bracket that fits most brands’ range oven surface element. The rated voltage is 2100 watts and the voltage is 240 volts. This replacement part will let you heat up anything from water or soup to sauce, stir fry and more. The package includes 1 x SP21YA 8 burner element. It used to replace many 8 inch burners with 4 turning rods and can be used on any stove with plug in rod iron elements. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBILITY】---SP21YA surface element 8 inch can fit for Ken-more, G-E burner and can be replaced with WB30X253, 316442300.◆Replaces Number: 91192090300, 91192090301, 91192091300, 91193090300, 91193090301, 91193091300, 91193091301, 91193401993, 91193410010, 91193411002 , 91193412000, 36262781001, 36262781002, 36262781003, 36262781004, 36262788000, 36262780101, 36262780102, , JCBP24WJ1WW, JCBP24WJ2WW, JCBP24WJ3WW, JCBP26BJ1BB, JCBP26BJ2BB, JCBP26BJ3BB, JCBP26WJ1WW, JCBP26WJ2WW, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】---SP21YA 8\"turn surface element supports 365 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【PREMIUM MATERIALS】---SP21YA 8 inch universal surface range element is made of non-metallic material with large resistivity, small temperature coefficient of resistance, low deformation at high temperature and not easy to embrittle. Well-tested by the manufacturer - Meets OEM standards - Ensure long-lasting and effective performance. ✅【NOTES】---Prepare a Phillips screwdriver and a pair of work gloves before installation.Remove screw pull old element out install new one put screw back in.You can usually identify a burnt-out element by blistering or small holes on the element's coils. Do not be alarmed if a new SP21YA surface element 8\" smokes a little when you first use it. If your Element will not heat or the surface element is not heating up and the end connection was corroded, you should replace burner surface element.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pB20LRSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087LR51QZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087LR51QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087LR51QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
