window.products.push({"id":116980,"name":"My-Cap's 3 Reusable/Refillable Capsules for Dolce Gusto Brewers | Compatible with Mini Me, Genio, Piccolo, Esperta and Circolo …","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D97E+mBqL._SL1024_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBILITY: These capsules work with all Dolce Gusto models including the Mini Me, Piccolo, Genio, Esperta and Circolo  This product includes reusable capsules for use with Dolce Gusto brewers. These reusable capsules for Dolce Gusto brewers allows you to fill your own Dolce Gusto capsules. Fill them with your favorite coffee and reuse them many times before they have to be thrown out. This lowers the cost of each cup and also gives you better brews each time. In addition, you will be reducing your environmental impact. Each time you reuse a Dolce Gusto capsule, you reduce the cost even more on a per-cup basis. The more you use them, the cheaper they get. Questions and Answers? Q: What brewers will the Capsules work in?  A: These refillable reusable capsules can be used with compatible Dolce Gusto brewers. This includes DeLonghi Piccolo, DeLonghi Creativa, DeLonghi Genio, DeLonghi Circolo, Melody2, and Krup's.   Q: How many times can the capsule be reused?  A: You should be able to reuse them over 50 times. It really depends on how careful you are with the capsule. It is pretty durable.   Q: What is the capsule made out of?  A: The capsules are are made out of new polypropylene, stainless steel, and silicone rubber.   Q: What coffee grind should I use?  A: Make sure you are using a good coffee, preferably something with a bold strong taste. The finer the grind the bolder/stronger the taste. If you are making an espresso, the grind MUST be an espresso grind. If you try and use regular coffee in the capsule it will come out weak.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D97E+mBqL._SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My-Cap","source_asin":"B01BYHMMTO","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BYHMMTO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BYHMMTO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":116981,"name":"Winado Portable Laundry Dryer, 3.22 cu ft Compact Laundry Dryer for Clothes, 13.2LB Front Load Stainless Steel Clothes Dryers W/ Exhaust Pipe, LCD Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zACftF6aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Drying】 Portable dryer capacity of 13.2 pounds, 1300W power dryer up to 140 ° F, after the completion of drying your clothes moisture content of only 3%, to ensure that your clothes dry quickly, rain and wet weather can also dry clothes. 【Thoughtful Design】The transparent window of this apartment dryer allows you to observe the delivery status of the dryer at any time, the cotton filter can effectively filter the skimmer and prevent it from flying out, and the portable design allows you to easily move the equipment to any place you like. 【3 Heating Settings & 5 Programs】The laundry dryer comes with 3 heating settings of full heat/companion heat/drying & 5 programs of intelligent/bulk/exquisite/standard/timing, you can choose the drying time according to the weight of the clothes you put in, and the drying temperature according to the material of the clothes. 【Safety & Simple Operation】Clothes dryer with LCD operation screen, and also with cycle status light, the status light will cycle when the dryer is running. If you open the door while the machine is running, it will automatically stop running to ensure your safety. 【Friendly to Clothes】The dryer will alternate between forward and reverse rotation to prevent tangles in clothing and wrinkle prevention. At the same time low noise design, 58-62 decibels low noise, so that you will not cause trouble in daily use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zACftF6aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winado","source_asin":"B0B1VBG6K1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1VBG6K1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1VBG6K1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
