window.products.push({"id":116983,"name":"Beaquicy W10518394 W10134009 Dishwasher Heating Element - PS8260087 Heating Element Replacement for Amana, Maytag, Kenmore 665, Whirlpool Dishwasher P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BiSCghoWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【EXCELLENT PERFORMANCE】- W10518394 ken-more dishwasher heating element heats the water during the dishwashing cycle and designed to monitor and control the heat of the water that enters the dishwasher. It helps dry the dishes at the end of the cycle. It is easy to install, only a few minutes of operation can save you a lot of money. FIX THE FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS:★The dishwasher is not drying dishes properly; ★The cleaning light blinks on the control panel; ★The dishwasher leaks or does not start. ✅【VALUE PACKAGE】- The package includes 1 x W10518394 Heating Element, 2 x heater fasteners. Dimensions: W 14.1\"x L 14.9\". The length of heater fastener: 1.53\". ☞The heating element is made of high-quality nickel-chromium alloy, which can withstand high temperatures and heat evenly. ☞After our material upgrade, the temperature of the product is lower than before, it will not melt the bottom of the dishwasher and work safer. ☞Heater fastener can protect element tips from bending and compression. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MANY BRANDS】-- W10518394 Heating Element replacement for Cros-ley, Whirl-pool, Ken-more, May-tag and other brands dishwasher. ►Replaces: 2977737, AP5690151, PS8260087, EAP8260087.Compatible: 66516032402, 66517519200, 66517519201, 66517519202, 66515113K216, 665.15112K215, wdf540padm2, wdf520padm3, wdf510pays6, wdt710paym6, wdf520padw5, wdt720padm3, wdf520padm7, wdf520padb7, wdf510paywa, wdt720padm1, wdt710paym4, gu2500xtps3, gu1500xtlq1, mdbh969awb5, adb1400ags1, adb1400pydo0, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The W10518394 Whirl-pool Dishwasher Heating Element support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ►The heating element is designed to maintain the heat of the water entering the machine. It is made of a nickel-chromium alloy material that can successfully withstand high temperatures and is less prone to deformation due to high temperatures. The plastic nut heater fasteners at both ends create an insulated connection and protect the heating element tip from bending and compression. ✅【DIY INSTALLTION】- Unplug the dishwasher before installing W10518394 heating element. The tools you need to prepare include: a small adjustable wrench, a phillips screwdriver, a needle nose pliers, a pair of work gloves. You can follow the Youtube video to install. Helpful Tips: ①Removing the entire dishwasher from the cabinet is recommended. ②When installing the element, make sure to use the existing bracket to lift the filter, it must hang so that it does not touch the dishwasher tub.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BiSCghoWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08NT8Z3D7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-116983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NT8Z3D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NT8Z3D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
